Z||000000||TRL46202||01-10-2000||10:47 AM||||Please tell me the proper way to set the timing. I took the car to Firestone to set the timing and noticed that you have to put the car in diagnostic mode? I asked them if they did this and they didn't know. I know you have to jumper A & B terminals on the connection behind the cigarette lighter but I thought that wa for checking codes and your not to start the car while in this mode? maybe I'm worng but someone please describe the sets involed and how many degrees either way. I have an 87GT 2.8 Auto.<P>Thanks so much.....||||reg||1
